title: NPC1_Menu
---
-> Dee: Show item <<if CheckHasAnyStoryItem()>>
    Hubert: You got something you want to show me ? 
    <<jump NPC1_ShowItem>>
-> Dee : Talk
    Hubert: Been a while since we talked right ? 
    Hubert: I feel like you're ignoring me.
    Hubert: But that's just in my head right.
    Hubert: Right ?
    <<jump NPC1_Menu>>
-> Dee : Bye
    Hubert: Nice day !
===

title: NPC1_ShowItem
---
-> Dee : Bubble <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Bubble")>>
    Hubert: Oh yeah I've seen it many times around here.
-> Dee : Ball <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Ball")>>
    Hubert: Looks brand new. You bought that ?
-> Dee : Slime <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Slime")>>
    Hubert: Uhhhh. Looks sticky.
-> Dee : Strange Stuff <<if CheckHasStoryItem("Strange Stuff")>>
    Hubert: I feel like this shouldn't even be in the office to be honest.
-> Dee : Back
    Hubert: What's up girl ?
    <<jump NPC1_Menu>>
=> Hubert: Wanna show me something else ?
=> Hubert: Anything else ?
=> Hubert: Other stuff you want me to look at ?
<<jump NPC1_ShowItem>>
===